memo-rag (0.15.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * memo-arcana rejoins the bus when its connection drops. It exited
    with status 0 when the bus restarted, so systemd left it stopped.
  * memo-arcana won't start while another one serves memo:rag: a second
    instance shared the address, and when either stopped, the bus
    dropped it for both.

